                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="2ecd-b4ff-9e78-a8e2">Up to 2 Clanrats, or 3 in a Warband worth 1,200 or more credits, can be upgraded to Globodiers at a cost of +10 credits each, granting them the Lobber Ability.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
                <profile name="Lober" id="b9c0-2965-32d9-71b5" hidden="false" typeId="058c-866b-6487-ccc4" typeName="Ability">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="2ecd-b4ff-9e78-a8e2">Increase the range of any THROWN weapon the Globodier is equipped with by 4”. It has +1 DICE to Hit with any such weapon, but attacks made beyond the weapon’s normal range, before this benefit, are made at -1 DICE.</characteristic>
