          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="More-More Whirling Death!" id="2461-8b8a-9a0e-fd55" hidden="false" typeId="058c-866b-6487-ccc4" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="2ecd-b4ff-9e78-a8e2">The Doom Flayer has +2 DICE to all Dash Success Rolls, but suffers a BLOOD MARKER after taking the Dash Action.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Weapon Mount" id="f711-b4a2-bf8a-2804" hidden="false" typeId="058c-866b-6487-ccc4" typeName="Ability">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="2ecd-b4ff-9e78-a8e2">The Doom Flayer can be equipped with either Whirling Blades, or a single additional TWO-HANDED ranged weapon, and ignores hand requirements and the HEAVY Keyword for that weapon. When it takes the Fight or Shoot Action, it can attack with this weapon in addition to any other attacks it makes, without off-hand penalties.</characteristic>
